  3.952273805759444*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"fe7e2340-e904-4987-a56b-\
eed10be77b3c"],

Cell["\<\
A numerical solution of the Time-Dependent Schr\[ODoubleDot]dinger Equation \
using a finite-domain time-difference method\
\>", "Subtitle",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8250709518981447`*^9, 3.8250709759955063`*^9}, {
  3.825082068444275*^9, 3.82508207728728*^9}, {3.8250822135724983`*^9, 
