 StyleBox["This visualisation confirms that the ",
  FontSize->16],
 StyleBox["square potential",
  FontSize->16,
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 StyleBox[" is displayed as expected. Additional plots for the quadratic and \
step potentials are provided below for comparison.",
  FontSize->16]
}], "Text",
